[00:03.58] A warm summer night
[00:19.62] The moon above us
[00:36.40] The stars for a wish come true
[00:52.16] Are memories of love
[01:08.24] A motionless pond
[01:24.52] A beautiful swan
[01:39.10] The smell of flowers growing near
[01:56.56] Make me shed a tear
[02:11.64] Memories of love gone by
[02:26.84] Make me stop and cry
